# Porter (objects)

When editing under `objects/`, you are implementing **one** handler from `tasks/handlers/0x*.md`.

- Mirror ASM branch structure; use `helpers.rs` for shared `$5Bxxx` behavior.
- Add `#[test]` with in-memory slot bytes; run `cargo test -p sml2-core`.
- Do not refactor unrelated handlers or read the whole legacy `objects.rs` monolith unless splitting per `docs/plans/2026-10-15-port-finish-reset.md`.

See `hermes/worker-handler.system.md` and `PORTING.md`.
